1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. exd5 cxd5 4. c4 Nf6 5. Nf3 e6 6. Nc3 Be7 (6... dxc4 { That's the trick, but not yet!!! now their bishop only have to move once. }) 7. Be2 { Remember the trick we we're going to try this time? } 7... dxc4 8. Bxc4 { Yep, we made their bishop move a second time. } 8... O-O { Now same plan to get this bishop out. } { [%cal Gb7b6,Gc8b7] } *


