1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 dxe4 { Yes, Rozman says that any time white leaves their pawn on e4 you take it. } 4. f3 { Do you remember Rozman's recommendation in response to this gambit? } 4... e3 { Yep! White wanted you to take their pawn and help them develop with initiative... } { [%cal Gd1f3,Ge4f3] } (4... exf3 { Even the engine likes this jam, but Rozman has a different recommendation. }) 5. Bxe3 { ... And now you get on with your development. } { [%cal Gg8f6,Gc8f5] } *


