1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 dxe4 4. Nxe4 Nf6 (4... Bf5 { That's the classical main line, but which response does Levy show first in the video? }) 5. Nxf6+ { Which recapture does Rozman consider more solid, leading to castling on the kingside? } 5... exf6 { Correct. the Tartakower Variation. now the plan is bishop out, castle and use those doubled pawns to defend against a kingside attack. } { [%csl Gf6,Gf7][%cal Gf8d6,Ge8g8] } (5... gxf6 { Nope, that one is the saucier option. }) *


